			"notes": "The strip of trim-material icons was still empty in 1.11.1: the ids became correct, but the icon table is keyed by bare paths (quartz) while the picked ids are namespaced (minecraft:quartz), so every icon lookup missed. Fixed, and each registry section now refreshes independently so one failure cannot blank the other pickers. Also fixed goat-horn labels reading 'minecraft:...' (e.g. 'Minecraft Ponder' instead of 'Ponder').\n\nSame jar layout: pick the one for your Minecraft version. 26.x needs Java 25, 1.21.x Java 21."
		},
